{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime Store Simulator is a small casual game where you operate a store that sells cute slimes! Order a variety of different types of slimes, set your own prices, take payments, hire help, and expand the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on lots of different slimes. The slimes vary in color, size, shape, price, and some even come with accessories.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_115135.png?t=1747586121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place the slimes on the shelf and set your own price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Slimes_in_game.png?t=1747586121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Checkout Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with different customers and sell your slimes at the register. The slime store accepts cash and credit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Early_Game_Screenshot.png?t=1747586121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage The Warehouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you get further along in the game you will unlock the warehouse where you can keep everything neatly stored in one place.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Warehouse_Screenshot.png?t=1747586121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you sell more slimes you will level up and make more money which will allow you to expand the 